<title>USA: Global Spill says in acquisition talks.</title>
<headline>Global Spill says in acquisition talks.</headline>
<dateline>WILLOW GROVE, Pa. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global Spill Management Inc said Friday that negotiations have commenced with several different acquisition candidates.</p>
<p>A decision on which acquisition to consummate will be made prior to the close of the current fiscal year on June 30, Global Spill said.</p>
<p>The company said aggregate indebtedness of about $6.7 million at June 30, 1995 has been reduced to about $62,000.</p>
</text>
